Description: VeltOS authentication prompt (Windows 11 style polkit agent)
 When a program needs an administrator's permission (installing apps,
 adding users, changing the time zone), the system's permission service
 (polkit) asks the session's authentication agent. This package provides
 that agent for VeltOS: a window in the layout of Windows 11's User
 Account Control prompt (shield band, the question, the program, the
 administrator's picture, the password box, Yes and No), in English and
 Turkish. The password is checked by polkit's own helper through PAM.
 .
 KDE's agent (polkit-kde-agent-1) stays installed but its session
 service is masked.
